{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_014","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 129","char_start":2486,"char_end":2516,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_015","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"An MPTokenIssuance entry represents a single MPT issuance and holds data associated with the issuance itself. You can create an MPTokenIssuance using an MPTokenIssuanceCreate transaction , and can delete it with an MPTokenIssuanceDestroy transaction .","location_hint":"paragraph 140","char_start":2774,"char_end":3025,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_016","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"Requires the MPTokensV1 amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 141","char_start":3027,"char_end":3073,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_017","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"{\n\"LedgerEntryType\" : \"MPTokenIssuance\" ,\n\"Flags\" : 131072 ,\n\"Issuer\" : \"rsA2LpzuawewSBQXkiju3YQTMzW13pAAdW\" ,\n\"AssetScale\" : 2 ,\n\"MaximumAmount\" : \"100000000\" ,\n\"OutstandingAmount\" : \"100\" ,\n\"TransferFee\" : 50000 ,\n\"MPTokenMetadata\" : \" …","location_hint":"paragraph 143","char_start":3109,"char_end":4646,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_018","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"By convention, the metadata should decode to JSON data describing what the MPT represents. The XLS-89 specification defines a recommended format for metadata. The above MPTokenMetadata field encodes the sample JSON from the spec, as a UTF-8 string with minimal whitespace.","location_hint":"paragraph 145","char_start":4655,"char_end":4927,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_019","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"In addition to the common fields , MPTokenIssuance entries have the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 147","char_start":4953,"char_end":5038,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_020","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"Field Name JSON Type Internal Type Required? Description","location_hint":"paragraph 148","char_start":5042,"char_end":5098,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_021","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"Issuer String - Address AccountID Yes The address of the account that controls both the issuance amounts and characteristics of a particular fungible token.","location_hint":"paragraph 149","char_start":5102,"char_end":5258,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_022","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"AssetScale Number UInt8 Yes Where to put the decimal place when displaying amounts of this MPT. More formally, the asset scale is a non-negative integer (0, 1, 2, …) such that one standard unit equals 10^(-scale) of a corresponding fractional unit. For example, if a US Dollar Stablecoin has an asset scale of 2 , then 1 unit of that MPT would equal 0.01 US Dollars. This indicates to how many decimal places the MPT can be subdivided. The default is 0 , meaning that the MPT cannot be divided into smaller than 1 unit.","location_hint":"paragraph 150","char_start":5260,"char_end":5779,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_023","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"MaximumAmount String - Number UInt64 No The maximum number of MPTs that can exist at one time. If omitted, the maximum is currently limited to 2 63 -1.","location_hint":"paragraph 151","char_start":5781,"char_end":5932,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_024","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"OutstandingAmount String - Number UInt64 Yes The total amount of MPTs of this issuance currently in circulation. This value increases when the issuer sends MPTs to a non-issuer, and decreases whenever the issuer receives MPTs.","location_hint":"paragraph 152","char_start":5934,"char_end":6160,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_025","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"LockedAmount String - Number UInt64 No The amount of tokens currently locked up (for example, in escrow). This amount is already included in the OutstandingAmount .","location_hint":"paragraph 153","char_start":6162,"char_end":6326,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_026","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"Requires the TokenEscrow amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 154","char_start":6328,"char_end":6375,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_027","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"TransferFee Number UInt16 Yes This value specifies the fee, in tenths of a basis point, charged by the issuer for secondary sales of the token, if such sales are allowed at all. Valid values for this field are between 0 and 50,000 inclusive. A value of 1 is equivalent to 1/10 of a basis point or 0.001%, allowing transfer rates between 0% and 50%. A TransferFee of 50,000 corresponds to 50%. The default value for this field is 0. Any decimals in the transfer fee are rounded down. The fee can be rounded down to zero if the payment is small. Issuers should make sure that their MPT&#x27;s AssetScale is large enough.","location_hint":"paragraph 155","char_start":6379,"char_end":6997,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_028","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"MPTokenMetadata String - Hexadecimal Blob Yes Arbitrary metadata about this issuance, in hex format. The limit for this field is 1024 bytes.","location_hint":"paragraph 156","char_start":6999,"char_end":7139,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_029","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"OwnerNode String - Hexadecimal UInt64 Yes A hint indicating which page of the owner directory links to this entry, in case the directory consists of multiple pages.","location_hint":"paragraph 157","char_start":7141,"char_end":7305,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_030","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"PreviousTxnID String - Hexadecimal UInt256 Yes The identifying hash of the transaction that most recently modified this entry.","location_hint":"paragraph 158","char_start":7307,"char_end":7433,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_031","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"PreviousTxnLgrSeq Number UInt32 Yes The index of the ledger that contains the transaction that most recently modified this object.","location_hint":"paragraph 159","char_start":7435,"char_end":7565,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_032","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"Sequence Number UInt32 Yes The Sequence (or Ticket ) number of the transaction that created this issuance. This helps to uniquely identify the issuance and distinguish it from any other later MPT issuances created by this account.","location_hint":"paragraph 160","char_start":7567,"char_end":7797,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_033","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"Flags are properties or other options associated with the MPToken object. Except for lsfMPTLocked , which can be mutated via MPTokenIssuanceSet transactions, these flags are immutable: they can only be set during the MPTokenIssuanceCreate transaction and cannot be changed later.","location_hint":"paragraph 162","char_start":7824,"char_end":8103,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_034","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"Flag Name Flag Value Description","location_hint":"paragraph 163","char_start":8107,"char_end":8139,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_035","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"lsfMPTLocked 0x00000001 If set, indicates that all balances are locked.","location_hint":"paragraph 164","char_start":8143,"char_end":8214,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_036","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"lsfMPTCanLock 0x00000002 If set, indicates that the issuer can lock an individual balance or all balances of this MPT. If not set, the MPT cannot be locked in any way.","location_hint":"paragraph 165","char_start":8216,"char_end":8383,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_037","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"lsfMPTRequireAuth 0x00000004 If set, indicates that individual holders must be authorized. This enables issuers to limit who can hold their assets.","location_hint":"paragraph 166","char_start":8385,"char_end":8532,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_038","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"lsfMPTCanEscrow 0x00000008 If set, indicates that individual holders can place their balances into an escrow.","location_hint":"paragraph 167","char_start":8534,"char_end":8643,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_039","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"lsfMPTCanTrade 0x00000010 If set, indicates that individual holders can trade their balances using the XRP Ledger DEX or AMM.","location_hint":"paragraph 168","char_start":8645,"char_end":8770,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_040","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"lsfMPTCanTransfer 0x00000020 If set, indicates that tokens held by non-issuers can be transferred to other accounts. If not set, indicates that tokens held by non-issuers cannot be transferred except back to the issuer; this enables use cases such as store credit.","location_hint":"paragraph 169","char_start":8772,"char_end":9036,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_041","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"lsfMPTCanClawback 0x00000040 If set, indicates that the issuer may use the Clawback transaction to claw back value from individual holders.","location_hint":"paragraph 170","char_start":9038,"char_end":9177,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_042","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"The ID of an MPTokenIssuance entry is the SHA-512Half of the following values, concatenated in order:","location_hint":"paragraph 172","char_start":9200,"char_end":9301,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_043","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"The MPTokenIssuance space key (0x007E).","location_hint":"paragraph 173","char_start":9305,"char_end":9344,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_90368c8bfc17_044","source_id":"src_90368c8bfc17","source_hash":"bbd1ac9511912b7a683bc3f5b153a3c7aefe5fbf9bb73b92ed45afc00e4e0ac2","text":"The transaction sequence number.","location_hint":"paragraph 174","char_start":9346,"char_end":9378,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:15:25.334Z"}
